## Small Source or Summary Files

| File | Format | Purpose | Source |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Genome sequence** | FASTA (.fasta) | Contains the complete *Lycoris radiata* chloroplast genome sequence for upload to Galaxy and sequence analysis. | NCBI RefSeq, **NC_045077.1** |
| **Annotated genome** | GenBank (.gb / .gbk) | Contains annotated genes, gene coordinates, CDS, tRNA, rRNA, introns, and other genome features. | NCBI RefSeq, **NC_045077.1** |
| **Genome summary** | TXT / Markdown (.txt / .md) | Summarizes the organism, accession number, genome size, GC content, and genome organization. | **NCBI RefSeq + Galaxy** |
| **Source information** | TXT / Markdown (.txt / .md) | Records the database source and accession used for the analysis. | **NCBI Nucleotide, NC_045077.1** |
